lection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "34"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346187" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that ${\\int }_{4}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-1$ and ${\\int }_{6}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=11,$ \nthen what is ${\\int }_{4}^{10}(6-3f(x))\\,\\text{d}x?$\n\n${\\int }_{4}^{10}(6-3f(x))\\,\\text{d}x=$ \n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346187" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the adjacent intervals rule, we know that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{4}^{6}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{6}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{4}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nPlugging in the known information gives\n\n$$\n(-1)+11={\\int }_{4}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x\\,⇒\\,{\\int }_{4}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=10.\n$$\n\nFinally, compute the desired integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{4}^{10}(6-3f(x))\\,\\text{d}x & =6{\\int }_{4}^{10}1\\,\\text{d}x-3{\\int }_{4}^{10}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =6\\cdot x{|}_{4}^{10}-3(10) \\\\  & =6(10-4)-30 \\\\  & =36-30 \\\\  & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346187" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b5d0ec2c5848b8f24d1396021f59046d97eba12d3520c179fc90f3c2667188de" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346187" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-346187" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Suppose that $f(x)$ is a function such that ${\\int }_{8}^{5}3f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-2$ and ${\\int }_{3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-3.$ What is the value of ${\\int }_{3}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's simplify one of the given integrals:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{8}^{5}3f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-2 \\\\ 3{\\int }_{8}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-2 \\\\ -3{\\int }_{5}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-2 \\\\ {\\int }_{5}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, from the adjacent intervals rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{3}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{5}^{8}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3+\\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/state.json" "file_sha256" "76d76912d15295676bb4fc66684a8bac36118bdf2205aeb877ef35e8ddf3f69d" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b5d0ec2c5848b8f24d1396021f59046d97eba12d3520c179fc90f3c2667188de" "basis" 1293 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037749/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-114143" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value"